      "status": "established",
      "current_assessment": "This week's CEE evidence provides the sharpest single-week illustration of the dynamic's core mechanism since creation: three NATO members in the same region adapted to the same structural condition — US security guarantee unreliability — through three mutually incompatible personal or improvisational mechanisms in the same week. Czech PM Babiš invoked Trump proximity ('I am a Trumpist') as an explicit substitute for NATO compliance while acknowledging the D11 highway accounting device will not pass NATO standards. Poland's Nawrocki used SMS messages to Trump's personal phone number to produce a Truth Social troop announcement that confused US defense officials, while PM Tusk publicly acknowledged his own inability to secure the same outcome through institutional channels. Romania absorbed the consequence: US Rep. Bacon explicitly placed Hegseth's troop reductions in the causal chain of the Galați strike severity. In the Americas, Canada and Brazil are independently running structurally identical dual-track strategies — rhetorical accommodation of US framing paired with concrete diversification actions (Saab over Boeing, China trade-doubling hint, Wang Yi Ottawa visit; sovereignty doctrine alongside tariff working group continuation) — without coordination between them. The simultaneity of three CEE adaptive mechanisms plus two Americas dual-track architectures plus Asia-Pacific declared-rationale hedging in the same analytical week confirms the dynamic's universalization across regional frameworks.",
