        "linkage_type": "parallel_behavior",
        "linkage_assessment": "Strong: three structurally distinct adaptive mechanisms in CEE, two independent dual-track architectures in the Americas, and a declared-rationale threshold crossing in Asia-Pacific all confirm the same structural condition producing differentiated bilateral management strategies across five regional frameworks."
