      "competing_interpretation": "Three separately motivated bilateral US actions peaking simultaneously because the Iran war is generating alliance pressure everywhere at once. Each country's adaptive strategy has a dominant domestic political explanation independent of US reliability as a shared structural condition.",
      "what_to_watch": "Whether the Czech D11 accounting failure and Babiš's non-compliance framing in FT produces any formal NATO response at the Ankara Summit — specifically whether Rutte's 'heavy lifters' omission becomes a formal mechanism or remains a rhetorical signal. Whether Brazil's tariff working group produces concrete concessions that the US explicitly invokes to pressure Canada, testing whether sequential asymmetry is architecturally designed.",
