      "what_to_watch": "Whether Germany's Kanzlertausch produces an actual leadership challenge before the Ankara Summit. Whether Britain's Makerfield by-election (June 18) resolves or deepens succession dynamics — a Burnham win creating active succession pressure during Ankara would be the most consequential domestic-security interaction documented in this ledger. Whether Romania's post-Galați formation pressure accelerates PSD-AUR coalition talks with Ukraine conditionality language.",
